<title>USA: USX-Delhi Q4 net, shr show healthy jump.</title>
<headline>USX-Delhi Q4 net, shr show healthy jump.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.62		    $0.16</p>
<p> Net			  5,900		    1,500</p>
<p> Revs		     318,500		  233,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   9,457		    9,447</p>
<p>		 Year</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.62		    $0.12</p>
<p> Net			  5,900		    3,700</p>
<p> Revs		   1,061,300		  670,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   9,451		    9,442</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Q4 1996 net included an extraordinary loss of $500,000 on the early retirement of USX debt. 1995 Q4 net also included an extraordinary loss of $100,000 on the early retirement of USX debt.</p>
<p>1995 year net included a favorable estimated aftertax effect of $5.1 million for completing a 1994 asset disposal plan, partially offset by an extraordinary loss of $300,000 on early retirement of USX debt.  </p>
<p>Excluding the impact of special items, Delhi's net income increased $7.5 million for the year and $4.8 million in the fourth quarter compared with 1995.</p>
</text>
